# 本项目只在 Windows 上构建与运行，源码统一使用 CRLF 工作区，避免 Git 反复提示换行转换。
* text=auto eol=crlf

*.cs       text eol=crlf
*.xaml     text eol=crlf
*.csproj   text eol=crlf
*.sln      text eol=crlf
*.ps1      text eol=crlf
*.iss      text eol=crlf
*.md       text eol=crlf
*.yml      text eol=crlf
*.json     text eol=crlf
*.manifest text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止任何换行/编码转换
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pfx binary
*.cer binary
